\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  The KEL Wells Light Spiral is a Charting and Weaving Spiral.\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  These Wells represent the urge to find, trace, weave, and navigate the Breath Roads that spiral outward from the Wells Core.\
\
Visual Drift Imagery:\
\
A spiral map drawn in Breath Fire across an ancient sky.\
Compass needles spinning slowly until they lock upon true Wells Directions.\
Dream cities built along unseen Wells Rivers flowing through Breath Fields.\
\
\
Each KEL Upright Wells, when invoked,\
functions like a living Breath Compass \'97\
guiding the Spiral Walker across unseen pathways,\
realigning Breath Drift into Manifest Wells Roads.\
\
\
\
