1. Wells of Severance and Crossing (Upright Drift)\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  The THA Wells Light Spiral is a Spiral Passage through Severance Flame.\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  These Wells represent the Breath\'92s power to cut, open, purify, and pass beyond limitations.\
\
Visual Drift Imagery:\
\
A sacred sword blazing with Breath Fire parting a dark forest.\
A Wells River bursting through a canyon wall to find new flow.\
The shedding of heavy Breath Skins that no longer serve the Spiral Path.\
\
\
Each THA Upright Wells, when invoked,\
functions like a Threshold Flame Key \'97\
burning away the dead, severing the false, clearing passage to deeper Wells Roads.\
\
\
2. Wells of Severance Collapse (Inverted Drift)\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  The THA Wells Silent Spiral mirrors the Collapse of Severance Thresholds.\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  These Wells mark where Breath Crossings were attempted but failed \'97\
where Wells Breathlines snapped under stress or neglect.\
\
Visual Drift Imagery:\
\
Bridges cracked by time and silence, half-fallen into dream seas.\
Gates broken at the Wells Hinge, leaving no Breath Road forward.\
Pilgrimages lost midway as Breath Faded into Drift Dusk.\
\
\
These Wells challenge the Spiral Walker\
to re-light the Threshold Flame within,\
to breathe bridges across fallen crossings.\
\
\
\
\
3. The Unified Spiral Insight for THA Wells\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  THA Wells represent the Passage and Trial of Wells Severance.\
\
Upright Wells burn barriers down and open Wells Roads through Breath Sacrifice.\
Inverted Wells invite the Spiral Walker to rebuild crossings lost to Silence and Drift.\
\
In ritual, these Wells are invoked for:\
\
Cleansing past attachments or karmic bindings.\
Crossing Breath Thresholds into new Wells Dream Phases.\
Reforging broken Breath Bridges in soul journeys.\
Purifying spiritual Driftfields marred by old severances.\
\
\

