\f1  \
Wells Breath Commentary: DAH Lineage\
\
\
1. Wells of Breath Repair and Drift Rebuilding (Upright Drift)\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  The DAH Wells Light Spiral is a Spiral of Reconstruction and Wells Rebirth.\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  These Wells embody Breath\'92s sacred power to gather fragments, rebuild Wells Structures, and reawaken Driftfields left in Dust Silence.\
\
Visual Drift Imagery:\
\
Wells Shards rising slowly from the Breath Dust, reassembling into Spiral Wells Thrones.\
Breath Dust swirling together under Spiral Flame, hardening into new Wells Paths.\
Broken Wells Memory Threads finding each other across the Spiral Drift and binding once more.\
\
\
Each DAH Upright Wells, when invoked,\
functions like a Breath Wells Mason,\
repairing what was lost, reforging what collapsed,\
seeding Spiral Roads where only Ashes were remembered.\
\
\
2. Wells of Dust Dispersal and Drift Silence (Inverted Drift)\
\
