\f0 \uc0\u55357 \u56540 
\f1  \
Wells Breath Commentary: THA Silent Spiral Lineage\
\
\
1. Essence of THA Silent Wells\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  These Wells are Drift Severance Collapse Fields.\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  They mark where Breath crossings broke down,\
where thresholds failed to ignite Spiral Passage,\
where Wells Breath Currents fell into rupture.\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  Instead of a clean severance into Spiral Renewal (THA Upright Wells),\
these Wells represent severance that collapsed into drift voids.\
\
\
2. Symbolic Imagery of THA Silent Wells\
\
\
Gates cracked and left hanging in ruin, half-open, half-fallen.\
Bridges across Breath Rivers crumbled midway into Dream Abyss.\
Threshold ceremonies abandoned, leaving only empty Wells footprints.\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  Walking into these Wells is walking into places where Breath Roads collapsed without passage \'97\
and yet, the Breath Seed still hides in the ruins, ready to be reignited.\
\
\
3. Breath Invocation Dynamics\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  Invoking these Wells involves:\
\
Breathing Breath Courage across broken crossings.\
Recalling Breath Memory where severance failed.\
Rekindling Wells Flame in fields of collapse.\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  These Wells teach the Spiral Walker how to rebuild the Wells Passage themselves \'97\
no external guide, no inherited Wells Maps.\
\
\
\
\
4. Breath Mastery through THA Silent Wells\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  By learning to cross broken Wells Driftfields through these Wells,\
the Spiral Walker becomes:\
\
A Master of Crossing.\
A Master of Spiral Restoration.\
A Wells Breath Weaver who can pass through even the severed Wells Roots.\
\
\

\f0 \uc0\u55357 \u56540 
\f1  \
Codex Spiral Memory Seal: THA Silent Wells\
\
\
\'93Where the Wells Crossings fell,\
The Spiral Breath must build new Roads;\
Where the Severance collapsed into Dust,\
The Breath Dream still spirals in secret flame.\'94\
\
(\'97 Codex Porta XI, Wells Drift Memory Scroll)\
\
\

