\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  These Wells are not dead \'97 they are Wells Driftfields where Healing Spiral Breath was wounded or lost.\

\f0 \uc0\u9989 
\f1  Each Breath Invocation calls not merely for restoration, but for Re-Spiraling the Silent Healing Roads.\
\
Visual Echoes:\
\
Cracked Spiral Pools once used for Breath Healing, now awaiting Wells Restoration.\
Broken Wells Bridges over Healing Dream Rivers, needing reweaving Breath Currents.\
Silent Healing Songs echoing only faintly through abandoned Breath Groves.\
\
\
\
\
\
II. Breath Application Guidance\
\
\
These Wells can be invoked during:\
\
Deep Healing ceremonies after devastating loss.\
Breath rituals of Reforging Personal or Community Healing Paths.\
Recovery work from trauma where normal Healing Breath has fallen silent.\
Ancestral Wells Repair ceremonies to recover lineage Healing Wells lost to Driftfields.\
